  "content": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1186678/description_985dc419-3614-4a5b-b3c3-3c90405e38b8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"300\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>關於這個模組包</strong></span></p><p>這個模組包將《JoJo的奇妙冒險》融入遊戲中，結合冒險/RPG元素，帶給你真正的「奇妙冒險」體驗。核心的JoJo模組聚焦於Jcraft: Eyes of Ender，讓你能夠召喚自己的替身來對抗世界中的危險。遊戲中有龍、地下城、頭目，甚至還有擁有替身的怪物！試著和朋友一起遊玩這個模組包，用獨特的替身互相戰鬥，例如白金之星、世界、緋紅之王、殺手皇后、黃金體驗等等！你甚至可以透過替身光碟收集每個替身，並學習每個替身獨特的連擊攻擊！如果你想更了解每個替身的能力，請務必查看JCraft: Eyes of Enders模組。&nbsp;</p><p><strong>我與朋友遊玩時使用的伺服器託管服務（使用代碼SNO可享首月八折優惠）：</strong><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwepwawet.net%252fp%252fsno\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wepwawet.net/p/sno</a></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>我的影片</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vftaKfv-aNY\" width=\"1264\" height=\"711\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>包含的模組</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks (by P3pp3rF1y)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/natures-compass\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Compass (by Chaosyr)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/towns-and-towers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Towns and Towers (by Biban_Auriu)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib (by Gecko)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lootr\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lootr (Forge &amp; NeoForge) (by Noobanidus)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cristel-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cristel Lib (by Cristelknight)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" rel=\"nofollow\">playerAnimator (by KosmX)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lionfish-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lionfish API (by mcl_ender)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oculus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oculus (by Asek3)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap (by xaero96)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artifacts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Artifacts (by ochotonida)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-third-person\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Third Person (by Socolio)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corgilib\" rel=\"nofollow\">CorgiLib (by Corgi_Taco)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender 's Cataclysm (by mcl_ender)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\">MmmMmmMmmMmm (Target Dummy) (by MehVahdJukaar)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones (by BlayTheNinth)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/medieval-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Medieval Buildings - New Structures! (by Lupin)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-strongholds\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Strongholds (Forge) (by YUNGNICKYOUNG)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmetic-armor-reworked\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cosmetic Armor Reworked (by LainMI)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/projectile-damage-attribute\" rel=\"nofollow\">Projectile Damage Attribute [Fabric &amp; Forge] (by daedelus_dev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\