com/minecraft/mc-mods/creativecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreativeCore (by CreativeMD)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice and Fire: Dragons (by sbom_xela)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selene\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moonlight Lib (by MehVahdJukaar)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender (Forge) (by TheAdubbz)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-trees-youll-grow\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Trees You'll Grow (by Corgi_Taco)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endremastered\" rel=\"nofollow\">End Remastered [NeoForge/Fabric] (by jack_bagel)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty (by Forstride)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise - Forge! (by Aureljz)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chunky-pregenerator-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chunky (Forge/NeoForge) (by pop4959)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API (by shedaniel)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/attributizer\" rel=\"nofollow\">Attributizer (by TheRealJackiecrazy)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI) (by mezz)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's API (Forge) (by YUNGNICKYOUNG)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apotheosis (by Shadows_of_Fire)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/attributefix\" rel=\"nofollo